## Submenu

`TxDropdownSubmenu` nests another panel inside the menu, at any depth. Hovering the trigger row expands it; pointer travel between the parent and child panels never closes the chain by mistake, and selecting a `TxDropdownItem` inside the child closes the whole chain following the root menu's `closeOnSelect`.

